#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:849
msgid ""
"Since the DIF format only supports a single worksheet, "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> only exports the top worksheet in the "
"view used to save the workbook."
msgstr ""
"Eftersom DIF-formatet bara stöder ett kalkylblad exporterar "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> endast det översta kalkylbladet i vyn "
"som användes när arbetsboken sparades."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:862
msgid ""
"Supported by the <quote>Data Interchange Format (DIF) module</quote> plug-"
"in."
msgstr "Stöds av insticksmodulen <quote>Datautbytesformat (DIF)</quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:874
msgid "The format is a text file, encoded in ASCII, with a header and body."
msgstr "Formatet är en ASCII-kodad textfil med huvud och brödtext."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:886
msgid ""
"The file can be processed as a text file or imported to any program that "
"recognizes the DIF format."
msgstr ""
"Du kan bearbeta filen som text eller importera den till ett program som "
"stöder DIF-formatet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:908
msgid "GNU Oleo File Format"
msgstr "Filformatet GNU Oleo"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:910
msgid ""
"The GNU Oleo file format is the format used by the GNU Oleo spreadsheet, one"
" of the early free software spreadsheets. The GNU Oleo project has stagnated"
" so this format is only supported to enable the import of old files."
msgstr ""
"GNU Oleo är filformatet i kalkylprogrammet GNU Oleo, ett av de tidiga "
"kalkylprogrammen med fri programvara. GNU Oleo-projektet har avstannat, så "
"formatet stöds endast för import av äldre filer."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:924
msgid "GNU Oleo"
msgstr "GNU Oleo"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:930 C/gnumeric.xml:2505
msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "Okänt"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:936
msgid "<application>GNU oleo</application>"
msgstr "<application>GNU oleo</application>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:942
msgid "Open Only"
msgstr "Endast öppning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:966
msgid "Supported by the 'GNU Oleo' plugin."
msgstr "Stöds av insticksmodulen ’GNU Oleo’."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:999
msgid "The HTML File Format"
msgstr "HTML-filformatet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1001
msgid ""
"The Hypertext Markup Language (HTML) file format is a text file format with "
"markup in the Hypertext Markup Language. These files are designed to be "
"viewed in a web browser."
msgstr ""
"Hypertext Markup Language (HTML) är ett textbaserat filformat med HTML-"
"taggar. Filerna är avsedda att visas i en webbläsare."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1007
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can save the cell contents in a "
"worksheet to a text file which consists either of entire, well formed HTML "
"files of version 3.2 or 4.0, or of a file fragment which contains only a "
"&lt;table&gt; structure and must be inserted into an HTML file. "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can also open files which consist only "
"of simple, well formed HTML &lt;table&gt; structures."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan spara cellinnehållet i ett "
"kalkylblad som en komplett, välformad HTML-fil i version 3.2 eller 4.0, "
"eller som ett filfragment med enbart HTML-tabellstrukturen &lt;table&gt;, "
"som måste infogas i en HTML-fil. <application>Gnumeric</application> kan "
"även öppna filer som bara innehåller enkla, välformade HTML-tabeller med "
"elementet &lt;table&gt;."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1020
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">Names:</emphasis>"
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">Namn:</emphasis>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1023
msgid "Hypertext Markup Language (HTML)"
msgstr "Hypertext Markup Language (HTML)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1035
msgid "Any Web Browser, any text editor"
msgstr "Valfri webbläsare eller textredigerare"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1041
msgid "Export only, but also can import HTML &lt;table&gt; structures"
msgstr ""
"Endast export, men kan även importera HTML-tabeller med elementet "
"&lt;table&gt;"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1055
msgid ""
"Only the cell contents of a worksheet are saved with sheet object elements, "
"such as graphical plots, ignored."
msgstr ""
"Endast cellinnehållet i kalkylbladet sparas. Bladobjekt, till exempel "
"diagram, ignoreras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1067 C/gnumeric.xml:1257 C/gnumeric.xml:3238
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3564
msgid "Supported by the 'HTML &amp; TeX' plugin."
msgstr "Stöds av insticksmodulen ’HTML &amp; TeX’."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1142
msgid ""
"All these files can be opened by any text editor. The HTML 3.2 and 4.0 "
"format files can be opened by any web browser such as "
"<application>Mozilla</application>."
msgstr ""
"Alla dessa filer kan öppnas i valfri textredigerare. HTML-filer i version "
"3.2 och 4.0 kan öppnas i valfri webbläsare, till exempel "
"<application>Mozilla</application>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1147
msgid ""
"Files which are generated as HTML fragments must be placed into an HTML file"
" with a valid pre-amble and closing statements."
msgstr ""
"Filer som skapats som HTML-fragment måste infogas i en HTML-fil med giltig "
"inledning och avslutning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1157
msgid ""
"<emphasis role=\"italic\">See Also:</emphasis> <link linkend=\"file-format-"
"xhtml\">XHTML Format</link>"
msgstr ""
"<emphasis role=\"italic\">Se även:</emphasis> <link linkend=\"file-format-"
"xhtml\">XHTML-format</link>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1175
msgid "LaTeX File Format"
msgstr "LaTeX-filformatet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1177
msgid ""
"The LaTeX file format is a text file format with markup in the LaTeX 2ε "
"derivative of the TeX family of languages."
msgstr ""
"LaTeX-formatet är en textfil med markup i LaTeX 2ε, en vidareutveckling inom"
" språkfamiljen TeX."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1182
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> generates LaTeX files to allow the "
"export of tables of numeric values for use in the LaTeX document processing "
"system. LaTeX is a derived format of the TeX system. The files generated by "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> are designed to be used by a LaTeX "
"processor, such as <application>latex</application> or "
"<application>pdflatex</application>, to generate files in viewable formats "
"such as Device Independent (DVI), PostScript (PS) or Portable Document "
"Format (PDF)."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> skapar LaTeX-filer så att du kan "
"exportera tabeller med numeriska värden till dokument i LaTeX. LaTeX är en "
"vidareutveckling av TeX. Filerna från <application>Gnumeric</application> är"
" avsedda att behandlas med en LaTeX-processor, till exempel "
"<application>latex</application> eller <application>pdflatex</application>, "
"för att skapa visningsbara format som Device Independent (DVI), PostScript "
"(PS) eller Portable Document Format (PDF)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1193
msgid ""
"The generated files can either be processed directly or can be included in "
"other LaTeX files."
msgstr ""
"Du kan antingen behandla de skapade filerna direkt eller infoga dem i andra "
"LaTeX-filer."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1217
msgid "<application>latex</application>, <application>pdflatex</application>"
msgstr "<application>latex</application>, <application>pdflatex</application>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1224 C/gnumeric.xml:2632 C/gnumeric.xml:2761
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3214
msgid "Export only"
msgstr "Endast export"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1237
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> generates a LaTeX "
"<literal>longtable</literal> structure which contains only the contents of "
"the cells in the worksheet displayed in the view at the time the file was "
"created."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> skapar en LaTeX-struktur av typen "
"<literal>longtable</literal> som endast innehåller cellerna i det kalkylblad"
" som visades när filen skapades."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1243
msgid ""
"Font coloring is supported. Thin cell borders are translated into single "
"lines and thick cell borders are translated into double lines. Cell "
"background colors are ignored."
msgstr ""
"Teckensnittsfärger stöds. Tunna cellkanter omvandlas till enkla linjer och "
"tjocka cellkanter till dubbla linjer. Cellernas bakgrundsfärger ignoreras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1269
msgid ""
"The generated file includes extensive documentation in TeX comment fields, "
"to explain how to use and alter the file. Lines in the file which are "
"comments begin and end with double percent symbols (%%). Lines which are "
"designed as user options begin with a single percent symbol (%) which can be"
" deleted to make the LaTeX command on that line take effect."
msgstr ""
"Den skapade filen innehåller utförlig dokumentation i TeX-kommentarer som "
"förklarar hur filen används och ändras. Kommentarer börjar och slutar med "
"två procenttecken (%%). Rader med användaralternativ börjar med ett "
"procenttecken (%). Ta bort tecknet om du vill att LaTeX-kommandot på raden "
"ska köras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1288
msgid ""
"The LaTeX files generated by <application>Gnumeric</application> can either "
"be processed directly by a LaTeX processor or can be included as tables in "
"other files. The files can be included by reference as explained below or "
"can be pasted into other files at the appropriate location. The file can "
"also be altered to change certain parameters. These alterations are "
"explained as comments within the file itself and are presented below."
msgstr ""
"Filer som skapas av <application>Gnumeric</application> kan behandlas direkt"
" med en LaTeX-processor eller infogas som tabeller i andra filer. Du kan "
"inkludera dem med en referens, enligt beskrivningen nedan, eller klistra in "
"dem på lämplig plats. Du kan även ändra vissa parametrar. Ändringarna "
"beskrivs i kommentarer i själva filen och tas upp nedan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1304
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"pdflatex Book1.tex\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"pdflatex Book1.tex\n"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1299
msgid ""
"The file created by <application>Gnumeric</application> can be run directly "
"through a LaTeX processor without any modifications. For example, if the "
"file were saved as <filename>Book1.tex</filename>, the following command "
"<_:screen-1/> generates a PDF file named <filename>Book1.pdf</filename>. The"
" file can be generated in landscape format and the headers, footers and "
"column widths of the file can be altered in the manner explained below."
msgstr ""
"Du kan köra filen från <application>Gnumeric</application> direkt genom en "
"LaTeX-processor utan att ändra den. Om du till exempel sparar filen som "
"<filename>Book1.tex</filename> skapar kommandot <_:screen-1/> en PDF-fil med"
" namnet <filename>Book1.pdf</filename>. Du kan skapa filen i liggande format"
" och ändra sidhuvud, sidfot och kolumnbredder enligt beskrivningen nedan."
